    "postMarkdown": "Your fine-tuned model weights are the crown jewels of your enterprise. Are they sitting unencrypted on a shared NFS mount?\n\nEnterprises spend millions fine-tuning models on proprietary trade secrets, customer records, and internal IP—only to store the resulting weights with minimal access control.\n\n1. Model Weight Watermarking & Cryptographic Signing: Embedding subtle mathematical watermarks to detect stolen weights if deployed outside sovereign infrastructure.\n\n2. Vector Store Role-Based Access Control: Ensuring RAG retrievers enforce row-level and tenant-level permissions so users cannot query documents above their clearance.\n\n3. Model Inversion & Extraction Defenses: Throttling high-volume synthetic queries designed to reconstruct proprietary training datasets from model outputs.\n\n4. End-to-End Pipeline Encryption: Encrypting training data at rest, in flight, and in GPU memory during active tensor calculation.\n\nTreat your AI models and embedding stores with the same rigorous cryptographic protection as your master banking keys.\n\n---\n→ Review TrustGrid's Model & Vector Pipeline Protection Blueprint: https://trustgrid.ai\n\n#DataPipelines #ModelProtection #IPSecurity #VectorDatabase #TrustGrid\n",
